Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.90,0:00:08.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Here is, uh-- Here's my résumé.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.61,0:00:11.95,Default,,0,0,0,,l mean, technically it says\N"curriculum vitae,"
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.12,0:00:16.12,Default,,0,0,0,,which l think is more\Nprofessional, but, you know,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.29,0:00:17.83,Default,,0,0,0,,same thing, pretty much.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.00,0:00:19.83,Default,,0,0,0,,MAN:\NThat's-- Wow, great.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.00,0:00:23.00,Default,,0,0,0,,This position truly is a\Nno-experience-necessary\Nkind of thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.17,0:00:26.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, and it doesn't\Nreally say it here,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.59,0:00:30.51,Default,,0,0,0,,but l have a solid\Nbackground in sales.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.68,0:00:32.64,Default,,0,0,0,,l'm pretty much a self-starter, so...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.81,0:00:35.02,Default,,0,0,0,,That's excellent, but--\NExcellent.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.18,0:00:39.31,Default,,0,0,0,,l just-- l really feel l could\Nbe a major,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.48,0:00:42.61,Default,,0,0,0,,major asset to your sales force.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.48,0:00:44.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.28,0:00:47.53,Default,,0,0,0,,l'm thinking there's\Na little misunderstanding.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.69,0:00:49.40,Default,,0,0,0,,This isn't actually\Na sales job.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.57,0:00:53.32,Default,,0,0,0,,l mean, l'd be happy\Nto consider you for\Na sales position,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.49,0:00:55.57,Default,,0,0,0,,but all our agents\Nneed to be licensed,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.74,0:00:58.20,Default,,0,0,0,,have at least two years\Non-the-job experience
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.41,0:00:59.95,Default,,0,0,0,,and usually\Na college degree.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.12,0:01:01.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.55,0:01:06.80,Default,,0,0,0,,What you'll be doing\Nis more like
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.96,0:01:08.84,Default,,0,0,0,,advertising.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.85,0:01:23.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Jesse.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.52,0:01:25.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.86,0:01:27.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Yo, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.19,0:01:29.11,Default,,0,0,0,,What up?\NBadger?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.28,0:01:31.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Where you been\Nkeeping yourself?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.49,0:01:34.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Nice duds.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.62,0:01:36.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah,\Nyou too.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.54,0:01:38.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.45,0:01:41.29,Default,,0,0,0,,JESSE:\NYo, why would you wanna do\Nthis lame-ass job, anyway?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.46,0:01:43.30,Default,,0,0,0,,l mean, no offense.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.46,0:01:44.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Because l'm on\Nprobation, yo.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.13,0:01:48.51,Default,,0,0,0,,l gotta prove to the man\Nl'm rehabilitated.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.67,0:01:51.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Upstanding citizen,\Nall that shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.97,0:01:54.72,Default,,0,0,0,,lt's really good\Nexercise too. Look.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.89,0:01:57.56,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't just stand there,\Nyou have to spin the arrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.72,0:02:01.01,Default,,0,0,0,,There's all these moves\Nyou have to learn, like\N"the helicopter."
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.90,0:02:05.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.19,0:02:07.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah. See, yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.61,0:02:08.99,Default,,0,0,0,,That one's a bitch.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.15,0:02:10.82,Default,,0,0,0,,l'm not very good\Nat it yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.99,0:02:13.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, you really opened\Nmy eyes to the possibilities.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.41,0:02:15.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah.\NHey, anyways,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.87,0:02:19.12,Default,,0,0,0,,thanks for the toke.\NAny time.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.29,0:02:20.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Speaking of which,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.62,0:02:25.00,Default,,0,0,0,,you think you could\Nmaybe hook me up\Nwith some crystal?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.75,0:02:28.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, no, l've been out of\Nthe business for a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.71,0:02:31.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Actually, now thinking\Nabout retiring.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.17,0:02:33.21,Default,,0,0,0,,What? No.\NYeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.38,0:02:35.80,Default,,0,0,0,,That stuff you made\Nis unbelievable.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.01,0:02:37.39,Default,,0,0,0,,lt was pretty awesome.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.55,0:02:38.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Retirement?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.06,0:02:41.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah! l can't be hearing this.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.43,0:02:45.52,Default,,0,0,0,,No, man, l had this partner\Nwho was helping me cook.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.69,0:02:48.11,Default,,0,0,0,,l mean, l was doing\Nmost of the work...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.23,0:02:52.36,Default,,0,0,0,,but he was an asshole, so. . .
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.53,0:02:55.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Anyway, l mean, pseudo's getting\Nharder and harder to come by and--
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.99,0:02:58.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Yo, l can hook you up\Nwith some pseudo.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.87,0:03:00.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Major pseudo.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.79,0:03:03.21,Default,,0,0,0,,l got channels, bro.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.37,0:03:04.87,Default,,0,0,0,,We could partner up.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.04,0:03:06.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.08,0:03:08.21,Default,,0,0,0,,No pressure.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.38,0:03:10.80,Default,,0,0,0,,No pressure. Just think\Nabout it, all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.00,0:03:13.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, shit. l gotta go.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.14,0:03:25.56,Default,,0,0,0,,BADGER:\NYo, this way to savings.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.73,0:03:27.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Save your dollar bills, y'all.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.40,0:03:29.78,Default,,0,0,0,,[SlGHS]
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.94,0:03:32.07,Default,,0,0,0,,[♪♪♪]
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.74,0:03:36.24,Default,,0,0,0,,♪ This way to savings\NThis way to savings ♪♪
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.95,0:03:41.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on!\NSave some money.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.08,0:03:50.16,Default,,0,0,0,,[♪♪♪]
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.77,0:04:08.31,Default,,0,0,0,,WALT:\Nlt's a stupid gift.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.52,0:04:10.10,Default,,0,0,0,,SKYLER:\NNo, it isn't. He'll love it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.27,0:04:11.94,Default,,0,0,0,,l don't know\Nwhat l was thinking.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.40,0:04:15.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Didn't the invitation\Neven say "no gifts"?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.28,0:04:16.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Walt.\NWhat?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.15,0:04:18.78,Default,,0,0,0,,We have to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.45,0:04:20.91,Default,,0,0,0,,l know, l'm not complaining.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.07,0:04:22.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.95,0:04:26.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, we need this.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.12,0:04:30.33,Default,,0,0,0,,We've been through\Na lot lately. Okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.13,0:04:33.30,Default,,0,0,0,,[BRONX RlVER\NPARKWAY'S "DElXA PRA LA"\NPLAYlNG OVER SPEAKERS]
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.46,0:04:36.63,Default,,0,0,0,,SKYLER:\NJesus, guess we didn't\Nget the "beige" memo.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.09,0:04:38.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, we're okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.09,0:04:42.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, l look like l'm wearing\Na prom dress from 1 985.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.60,0:04:44.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Honey, you look fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.43,0:04:47.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Walt, this is the only thing\Nl could find that fit me.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.06,0:04:52.81,Default,,0,0,0,,God, would you look at that.\NThe invitation said "no gifts."
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.15,0:04:55.36,Default,,0,0,0,,So? Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.57,0:04:58.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Sir, l'll take that\Nfor you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.36,0:05:03.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you.\NYou're welcome.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.16,0:05:06.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Ahem. Oh, look,\Nthere's Elliott.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.16,0:05:09.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, come on,\Nlet's go say hello.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.08,0:05:12.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Elliott. Ha.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.59,0:05:15.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Walt. You made it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.63,0:05:17.17,Default,,0,0,0,,[WALT LAUGHS]
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.34,0:05:19.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Happy birthday.\NWouldn't miss it for the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.34,0:05:20.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you. Skyler.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.97,0:05:23.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Hi. Oh. Oh, that's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.10,0:05:26.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Great to see you.\NYou look beautiful,\Nas always.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.64,0:05:29.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh. Well, these days a little\Nmore big than beautiful, but.. .
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.02,0:05:33.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course, congratulations.\NThat was such great news.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.69,0:05:37.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you.\NGretchen, look who's here.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.19,0:05:40.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh.\NWALT: Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.03,0:05:42.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, it's been ages.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.66,0:05:45.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, it's so good to see you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.41,0:05:48.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, it's really good.\NHeh-heh.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.50,0:05:50.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Skyler, welcome.\NCongratulations.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.25,0:05:52.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you.\Nlt's really nice to be here.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.75,0:05:55.54,Default,,0,0,0,,When are you due?\NSKYLER: ln about 1 0 more weeks.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.71,0:05:59.59,Default,,0,0,0,,And actually, we recently\Nfound out that it's a girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.76,0:06:02.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, that's so wonderful.\NYeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.68,0:06:05.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, we've been\Nthinking about it\Nfor ourselves.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.35,0:06:06.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, thinking about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.76,0:06:08.26,Default,,0,0,0,,[CHUCKLES]
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.43,0:06:11.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh, oh, hey, by the way,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.94,0:06:14.90,Default,,0,0,0,,securing that patent\Nwas just amazing.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.06,0:06:17.69,Default,,0,0,0,,l mean, the work that\Nyour company is doing...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.15,0:06:20.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Congratulations\Nto both of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.07,0:06:24.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Hard work and a lot of luck. A lot.\NYeah. Oh, well, now.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.95,0:06:26.08,Default,,0,0,0,,MAN:\NElliott.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.24,0:06:28.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh, will you excuse us?\NWe gotta say hi.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.24,0:06:30.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Make yourselves at home,\Nwe'll catch up later.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.29,0:06:31.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Sure, sure. Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.79,0:06:33.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay.\NSo glad you're here.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.42,0:06:34.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you.\NBye.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.08,0:06:36.79,Default,,0,0,0,,ELLlOTT:\NJohn, Missy. How are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.96,0:06:38.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Shall we?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.09,0:06:42.30,Default,,0,0,0,,MAN:\NCongratulations.\NHappy birthday.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.39,0:06:49.47,Default,,0,0,0,,[MUSlC PLAYlNG lN DlSTANCE]
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.72,0:06:51.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.56,0:06:53.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.46,0:07:17.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Hm. Hm.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.63,0:07:26.30,Default,,0,0,0,,[COUGHlNG]
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.36,0:07:49.49,Default,,0,0,0,,[BRONX RlVER\NPARKWAY'S "MAS Y MAS"\NPLAYlNG OVER SPEAKERS]
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.04,0:07:56.67,Default,,0,0,0,,[SPEAKlNG lNDlSTlNCTLY]
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.83,0:07:58.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Walt?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.29,0:07:59.83,Default,,0,0,0,,l thought\Nthat was you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.00,0:08:03.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Farley.\NLong time no see.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.30,0:08:05.34,Default,,0,0,0,,This is Walter White.\NOh. Hello.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.51,0:08:07.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Back at Caltech,\Nhe was--
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.34,0:08:09.84,Default,,0,0,0,,You were just a master\Nof crystallography.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.01,0:08:11.01,Default,,0,0,0,,l remember\Nthis one time
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.18,0:08:16.23,Default,,0,0,0,,we were stuck on this\Nprotein problem for weeks.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.39,0:08:18.72,Default,,0,0,0,,You just breezed\Nright in,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.90,0:08:20.69,Default,,0,0,0,,and you had\None word for us...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.86,0:08:21.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Synchrotrons.\NMm.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.15,0:08:23.73,Default,,0,0,0,,lt was synchrotrons,\Nyeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.90,0:08:25.03,Default,,0,0,0,,They generate pure
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.19,0:08:27.53,Default,,0,0,0,,and more complete\Npatterns than x-ray beams.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.70,0:08:30.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Data collection takes\Na fraction of the time.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.99,0:08:33.37,Default,,0,0,0,,This is the White\Nin Gray Matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.79,0:08:36.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Tell them, Walt.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.41,0:08:37.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.91,0:08:41.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, back when Elliott and l\Nwere in grad school,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.33,0:08:42.91,Default,,0,0,0,,we came up with\Nthe name. Ahem.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.09,0:08:46.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Schwartz, black.\NWalter White.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.34,0:08:49.26,Default,,0,0,0,,So together they became\NGray Matter Technologies.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.43,0:08:52.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Cute, huh?\NSo you run the company with Elliott?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.22,0:08:55.01,Default,,0,0,0,,No. No, that's\NGretchen and Elliott.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.18,0:08:58.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, yeah. You know,\Nl gravitated toward education.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.56,0:09:00.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah. What university?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.19,0:09:07.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, wow,\Nit's a Stratocaster.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.24,0:09:09.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Not just any Strat.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.53,0:09:10.91,Default,,0,0,0,,That's one of Clapton's.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.07,0:09:12.07,Default,,0,0,0,,ELLlOTT:\NNo way.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.24,0:09:17.74,Default,,0,0,0,,"To Elliott, sorry about the\Nbuckle rash, Eric Clapton."
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.91,0:09:20.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you.\NThis is beautiful.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.87,0:09:22.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Why is he doing this?\NELLlOTT: Beautiful.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.92,0:09:24.76,Default,,0,0,0,,What is he, like 8 years old?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.92,0:09:26.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Here, honey.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.97,0:09:31.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.43,0:09:32.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, this is from Walt.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.76,0:09:34.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, God.\Nlt's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.22,0:09:37.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.27,0:09:40.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's see what we got.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.44,0:09:48.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Yum Good Ramen.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.29,0:09:59.42,Default,,0,0,0,,[ELLlOTT LAUGHlNG]
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.62,0:10:04.33,Default,,0,0,0,,This is what Walt\Nand l lived on
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.50,0:10:06.96,Default,,0,0,0,,for, uh, 1 0 months straight
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.13,0:10:09.97,Default,,0,0,0,,while we were working\Non our thesis.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.13,0:10:13.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Sold them down at Ralstow's\Nin the hardware aisle.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.26,0:10:15.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Right next to the--\NWhat was it?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.26,0:10:17.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Sterno. Yeah.\NELLlOTT: The Sterno.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.60,0:10:19.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, 1 0 for\Na dollar ninety-nine.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.81,0:10:22.81,Default,,0,0,0,,To this day, l am convinced\Nthese noodles
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.98,0:10:25.15,Default,,0,0,0,,were responsible\Nfor our success.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.31,0:10:27.48,Default,,0,0,0,,This was our lifeblood.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.65,0:10:31.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Man, where'd you find these?\Nl thought they'd been outlawed\Nyears ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.40,0:10:33.15,Default,,0,0,0,,[PEOPLE CHUCKLlNG]
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.32,0:10:34.99,Default,,0,0,0,,l love it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.16,0:10:38.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you, Walt.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.33,0:10:40.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Well.. .
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.12,0:10:43.04,Default,,0,0,0,,For the man\Nwho has everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.29,0:10:45.46,Default,,0,0,0,,ELLlOTT: No, no, no.\NWALT: lt was.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.63,0:10:46.80,Default,,0,0,0,,ELLlOTT:\NNo, you remember the fat guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.96,0:10:49.29,Default,,0,0,0,,WALT: Yes.\NWe used to call him Snot Trough.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.46,0:10:51.04,Default,,0,0,0,,He had that thing\Nunder his nose.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.21,0:10:53.80,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you call that thing?\NThat was Dobkins.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.97,0:10:55.85,Default,,0,0,0,,That was the same guy\Nwho always smelled like\Nchocolate milk.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.01,0:10:57.05,Default,,0,0,0,,[LAUGHS]
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.22,0:10:58.85,Default,,0,0,0,,lt was.\NNo, no, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.01,0:11:01.35,Default,,0,0,0,,lt wasn't Dobkins,\Nit was...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.52,0:11:05.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Anyway, l swear to Christ,\Nhe used to iron those patches
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.19,0:11:08.53,Default,,0,0,0,,onto the elbows of his\NMembers Only jacket
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.69,0:11:11.19,Default,,0,0,0,,because he thought it made him\Nlook more distinguished.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.36,0:11:12.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Didn't it? l thought it--\NNo.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.15,0:11:14.53,Default,,0,0,0,,[BOTH LAUGHlNG]
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.70,0:11:17.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, God.\NWell, here's to Snot Trough.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.20,0:11:18.99,Default,,0,0,0,,To Snot Trough.\NWherever you may be.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.16,0:11:20.83,Default,,0,0,0,,God bless him.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.33,0:11:27.50,Default,,0,0,0,,And you remember the\Nprofessor who used to hate\NRobert Wilhelm Bunsen?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.67,0:11:30.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes. All you had to do was\Nmention the Bunsen burner
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.88,0:11:32.92,Default,,0,0,0,,and he was off on a rant.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.09,0:11:36.22,Default,,0,0,0,,"Oh, he didn't invent it."\NDo you remember the waving?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.38,0:11:39.17,Default,,0,0,0,,"He just improved it,"\Nyou know.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.35,0:11:41.02,Default,,0,0,0,,lt was easy to kill\N1 5 minutes.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.18,0:11:42.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.89,0:11:47.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, God.\Nl miss this, Walt.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.60,0:11:50.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah. Me too.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.40,0:11:52.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen, we ought to get\Ntogether more often.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.73,0:11:57.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Skyler and l would love\Nto have you and Gretchen\Nover for dinner sometime.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.20,0:11:59.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, sure, yeah,\Nabsolutely.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.24,0:12:05.08,Default,,0,0,0,,But, you know, what l mean\Nis that you and l should\Nwork together again.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.29,0:12:10.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you gonna teach high school?\NNo, no, no, seriously.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.25,0:12:12.59,Default,,0,0,0,,What's stopping us?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.38,0:12:17.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait a minute, Elliott,\Nwhat are you--?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.01,0:12:20.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you asking me to come\Nwork for you at Gray Matter?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.93,0:12:22.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, why not?\NYou'd fit right in.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.10,0:12:26.44,Default,,0,0,0,,You're brilliant,\Nyou got a ton of experience.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.60,0:12:28.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, l . ..
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.39,0:12:31.81,Default,,0,0,0,,l wouldn't really know\Nwhere to begin. l mean. . .
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.02,0:12:34.10,Default,,0,0,0,,God, you have no idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.28,0:12:38.28,Default,,0,0,0,,l spend my days just\Ndrawing out atoms\Non the chalkboard
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.45,0:12:41.33,Default,,0,0,0,,and trying to get these kids\Nto learn the periodic table.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.53,0:12:43.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, l understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.58,0:12:47.12,Default,,0,0,0,,You're a little rusty,\Nbut you're not seeing\Nthe upside here.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.29,0:12:51.00,Default,,0,0,0,,We could really benefit\Nfrom a new set of eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.17,0:12:53.96,Default,,0,0,0,,You know what it's like\Nwhen you've been trying\Nto crack some problem
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.13,0:12:56.17,Default,,0,0,0,,for months on end,\Nyou get tunnel vision.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.34,0:13:01.26,Default,,0,0,0,,One guy thinking outside\Nof the box, you may be\Nexactly what we need.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.61,0:13:19.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, listen, Elliott, it--
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.11,0:13:23.45,Default,,0,0,0,,The offer is very appealing,\Nit really is, l thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.83,0:13:27.00,Default,,0,0,0,,But there's.. .
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.16,0:13:29.50,Default,,0,0,0,,There's something\Nyou should know.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.71,0:13:36.51,Default,,0,0,0,,l have some personal issues.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.67,0:13:39.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, there's nothing\Nwe can't work out.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.17,0:13:41.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, yeah,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.63,0:13:44.22,Default,,0,0,0,,but it's complicated.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.97,0:13:46.64,Default,,0,0,0,,We can help you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.81,0:13:49.52,Default,,0,0,0,,We have excellent\Nhealth insurance.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.02,0:13:53.85,Default,,0,0,0,,The best.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.53,0:14:02.66,Default,,0,0,0,,[SPEAKlNG lNDlSTlNCTLY]
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.71,0:14:17.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Ahem. Um, hey, did you try\Nthose prosciutto-wrapped figs?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.42,0:14:19.38,Default,,0,0,0,,They were, like, wow.\NThey were just--
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.55,0:14:22.05,Default,,0,0,0,,l must have had about\N30 of those suckers.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.22,0:14:24.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, and the seafood table,\Ndid you see that?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.43,0:14:27.89,Default,,0,0,0,,They had lobster tail,\Nthey had crab legs,\Nlike, shrimp.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.06,0:14:29.64,Default,,0,0,0,,They had...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.39,0:14:35.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Walt.\NWhat the hell did you say to Elliott?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.90,0:14:37.78,Default,,0,0,0,,What?\NYou told him about the cancer,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.94,0:14:40.86,Default,,0,0,0,,didn't you? Didn't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.03,0:14:43.24,Default,,0,0,0,,l can't believe it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.40,0:14:47.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, we were talking,\Nhe asked how you were\Ndoing,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.20,0:14:52.12,Default,,0,0,0,,and l am sorry, but l don't have\Nthe best poker face these days\Nwhere that's concerned.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.29,0:14:55.96,Default,,0,0,0,,He knew something was wrong\Nwith you, and he pressed me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.17,0:14:57.71,Default,,0,0,0,,He pressed you? Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.88,0:15:00.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Walt, when it came\Nright down to it,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.71,0:15:03.09,Default,,0,0,0,,l didn't know what else to do\Nbut tell him the truth.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.26,0:15:07.10,Default,,0,0,0,,The truth? Well, how about\Nyou just said, "He's fine," huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.18,0:15:12.31,Default,,0,0,0,,You think maybe you could\Njust have said that? "He's fine."\NAnd then it would have been done.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.48,0:15:14.27,Default,,0,0,0,,l don't like the way\Nyou're talking to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.44,0:15:17.11,Default,,0,0,0,,l don't like the way you talk\Nabout my private affairs
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.27,0:15:21.27,Default,,0,0,0,,to people who are not\Neven in our lives anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.44,0:15:23.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, what exactly\Ndid he say to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.11,0:15:25.44,Default,,0,0,0,,He offered me a job.\NWhat?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.61,0:15:29.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes. Kind of like some\Nfig leaf, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.33,0:15:31.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Some face-saving\Nbullshit
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.95,0:15:35.16,Default,,0,0,0,,that allowed me to\Ngenerously accept\Nhis charity.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.33,0:15:37.83,Default,,0,0,0,,And then when l turned\Nthat down, he flat out
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.00,0:15:40.13,Default,,0,0,0,,offered to pay\Nfor my treatment.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.29,0:15:43.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Which is exactly what\Nyou expected him to do,\Ndidn't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.92,0:15:44.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Walt.\NDidn't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.13,0:15:48.17,Default,,0,0,0,,No. l did not put him up--\NPlease. Come on. Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.34,0:15:50.80,Default,,0,0,0,,[COUGHlNG]
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.10,0:15:53.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, what did you say?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.64,0:15:57.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Walt?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.98,0:15:59.81,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you think l said?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.65,0:16:03.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Why? Walt.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.37,0:16:53.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Hm. Ready to go?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.49,0:16:56.49,Default,,0,0,0,,l'm taking the bus.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.87,0:17:01.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.59,0:17:04.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Bye, honey.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.75,0:17:45.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, dude.\NAre these bullet holes?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.75,0:17:47.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh. ..
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.55,0:17:50.55,Default,,0,0,0,,No, man. Those are for,\Nlike, you know,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.72,0:17:52.76,Default,,0,0,0,,uh, ventilation.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.55,0:17:54.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.05,0:17:59.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Ooh. Nice setup, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.64,0:18:01.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Man.\NThis is nothing, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.94,0:18:04.90,Default,,0,0,0,,l used to have, like,\Ntwice as much glassware,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.06,0:18:07.81,Default,,0,0,0,,until my dumb-ass\Nex-partner
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.98,0:18:11.27,Default,,0,0,0,,drove us into a ditch\Nand wrecked most of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.45,0:18:13.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Big-ass beaker, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.16,0:18:17.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, wait, wait, no, that's--\NYeah, that's a boiling flask.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.79,0:18:19.92,Default,,0,0,0,,This is a beaker.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.08,0:18:24.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Here's a Griffin beaker.\NHere's a volumetric beaker.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.96,0:18:27.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Here's an Erlenmeyer flask.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.96,0:18:29.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Um, you got--
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.26,0:18:31.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow. You really\Nknow your shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.97,0:18:34.51,Default,,0,0,0,,lt's just basic chemistry, yo.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.14,0:18:38.02,Default,,0,0,0,,So...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.18,0:18:40.18,Default,,0,0,0,,you got something for me?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.39,0:18:42.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Aw, hells, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.11,0:18:56.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay. We're in business.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.82,0:18:57.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Right on, Badger.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.03,0:19:00.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Dude, check\Nthis out.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.00,0:19:02.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Jesus.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.46,0:19:03.96,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell are you\Nbringing that for?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.12,0:19:05.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Hunting.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.13,0:19:08.47,Default,,0,0,0,,We might see javelinas.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.34,0:19:16.68,Default,,0,0,0,,[FUJlYA & MlYAGl'S "UH" PLAYlNG]
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.07,0:19:38.40,Default,,0,0,0,,[lMlTATES DARTH VADER]
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.57,0:19:40.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you gonna help me\Nor what?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.50,0:19:46.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.96,0:19:53.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Badger!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.01,0:20:03.89,Default,,0,0,0,,BADGER:\NHuh? Huh? Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.06,0:20:06.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, buddy. Huh? Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.52,0:20:53.31,Default,,0,0,0,,BOY:\NLet's see the money.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.77,0:20:55.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.28,0:20:57.41,Default,,0,0,0,,l need five each.\NCome on, two more.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.57,0:20:59.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.03,0:21:01.53,Default,,0,0,0,,What about him?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.45,0:21:04.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you kidding?\NHe looks younger than us.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.79,0:21:06.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Whatever.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.08,0:21:08.62,Default,,0,0,0,,What about\Nthat guy?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.79,0:21:10.62,Default,,0,0,0,,No, he looks like\Na businessman.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.79,0:21:11.83,Default,,0,0,0,,BOY:\NSo what?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.04,0:21:14.67,Default,,0,0,0,,So businessmen\Nare always in a hurry.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.84,0:21:18.13,Default,,0,0,0,,They're always, like, going\Nto some meeting or something.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.30,0:21:20.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Seriously, he's just\Ngonna say no.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.30,0:21:24.18,Default,,0,0,0,,BOY:\NHey, hey, this guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.35,0:21:26.64,Default,,0,0,0,,This is our guy.\NYou're up.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.81,0:21:28.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh? Why do l\Nhave to do it?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.81,0:21:30.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Give me the crutches\Nand l'll go do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.69,0:21:34.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.78,0:21:38.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Um, excuse me, hey,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.15,0:21:41.32,Default,,0,0,0,,we forgot our lDs,\Nand we were wondering
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.49,0:21:45.16,Default,,0,0,0,,if you could do us a favor\Nand buy us a six-pack?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.33,0:21:47.96,Default,,0,0,0,,You know, what you're\Nasking is illegal.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.12,0:21:50.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Um, no, it's not.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.83,0:21:52.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.00,0:21:55.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.67,0:22:00.01,Default,,0,0,0,,COP:\NGuess you win the jackpot.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.38,0:22:03.67,Default,,0,0,0,,COP:\NThis is not how l wanted\Nto spend my night off.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.35,0:22:07.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Consider this your first\Nand last warning.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.18,0:22:08.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.35,0:22:10.18,Default,,0,0,0,,You're lucky you\Ngot a good dad here.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.23,0:22:20.36,Default,,0,0,0,,lf the other guys hadn't run,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.53,0:22:23.37,Default,,0,0,0,,l could've talked my way out of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.53,0:22:25.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Not cool, man. Not cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.87,0:22:29.37,Default,,0,0,0,,What, you never tried to buy\Nbeer when you were my age?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.54,0:22:32.50,Default,,0,0,0,,No, l'm talking about you\Ncalling me and not your father.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.87,0:22:34.87,Default,,0,0,0,,How do you think\Nthat'd make him feel?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.14,0:22:47.72,Default,,0,0,0,,SKYLER:\Nl don't even know\Nwhat to say to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.18,0:22:52.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Just go.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.39,0:22:54.56,Default,,0,0,0,,l'll deal with you later.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.73,0:23:01.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Phew.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.19,0:23:02.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Where's Walt?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.16,0:23:07.70,Default,,0,0,0,,l haven't seen him since\Nthis morning. Your guess\Nis as good as mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.08,0:23:10.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen, do me a favor,\Nall right?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.41,0:23:12.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't tell him about the kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.54,0:23:15.46,Default,,0,0,0,,He's just a teenager\Ntrying to score some beer.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.38,0:23:17.92,Default,,0,0,0,,You know,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.59,0:23:19.92,Default,,0,0,0,,just growing pains.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.80,0:23:24.43,Default,,0,0,0,,l mean, he finds out\Nhis dad's sick, he starts\Nacting out, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.59,0:23:27.30,Default,,0,0,0,,First the pot,\Nthen this.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.47,0:23:28.93,Default,,0,0,0,,The pot?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.10,0:23:33.93,Default,,0,0,0,,You told me the kid\Nwas smoking reefer.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.10,0:23:35.27,Default,,0,0,0,,That's what Skyler told me.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.44,0:23:39.78,Default,,0,0,0,,l mean, you may as well have.\Nl wasn't talking about Walter, Jr.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.94,0:23:42.78,Default,,0,0,0,,[WHlSPERlNG]\Nl was talking about Walt.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.45,0:23:46.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Excuse me?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.11,0:23:49.49,Default,,0,0,0,,He admitted it.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.49,0:23:52.95,Default,,0,0,0,,He said he liked it.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.45,0:23:54.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Walt?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.71,0:23:56.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Mm-hm.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.46,0:23:58.50,Default,,0,0,0,,[HANK LAUGHlNG]
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.21,0:24:01.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.59,0:24:07.01,Default,,0,0,0,,l didn't think\Nhe had it in him.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:07.22,0:24:08.68,Default,,0,0,0,,[lN NORMAL VOlCE]\Nlt's like he's not himself lately.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:08.84,0:24:10.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah.\Nl mean,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:10.80,0:24:14.26,Default,,0,0,0,,why would anyone in their\Nright mind choose not to\Ndo treatment?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:14.43,0:24:17.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Especially when\Nit's completely paid for.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:17.48,0:24:19.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Why is he doing this?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:20.48,0:24:22.31,Default,,0,0,0,,You know what\Nwe need to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:22.48,0:24:25.48,Default,,0,0,0,,What we really need to do\Nis sit him down, all of us,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:25.65,0:24:27.94,Default,,0,0,0,,and get everything out\Non the table.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:28.11,0:24:30.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Talk it all through.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:30.66,0:24:33.66,Default,,0,0,0,,You mean an intervention?\NNo, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:33.83,0:24:37.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Just a family meeting.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:37.46,0:24:40.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Where everyone\Ncan voice their concerns
Dialogue: 0,0:24:40.79,0:24:43.17,Default,,0,0,0,,and be heard.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:51.14,0:24:53.23,Default,,0,0,0,,BADGER:\NYou are a genius, bro.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:53.39,0:24:55.39,Default,,0,0,0,,This cankenstein is unreal.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:55.56,0:24:57.73,Default,,0,0,0,,When we get back, l'm gonna\Nburn that dollar-bill suit
Dialogue: 0,0:24:57.89,0:25:01.18,Default,,0,0,0,,because we're gonna\Nmake some mad dough.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:02.06,0:25:04.06,Default,,0,0,0,,lt's not right.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:04.28,0:25:05.82,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you mean,\Nit's not right?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:07.53,0:25:11.16,Default,,0,0,0,,lt's cloudy. lt's not\Nsupposed to be cloudy.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:11.32,0:25:14.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, that last time,\Nit was glass.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:14.20,0:25:19.20,Default,,0,0,0,,So what? Cloudy, not cloudy?\Nlt looks good enough to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:21.04,0:25:23.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Good enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:25.00,0:25:28.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, wait.\NYo, what are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:32.39,0:25:33.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Aah!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:33.60,0:25:36.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you out of\Nyour mind? l totally\Nwould've smoked that.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:36.52,0:25:38.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, it's not for you,\Nit's for our customers.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:38.85,0:25:40.77,Default,,0,0,0,,They're gonna demand\Na certain standard.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:40.94,0:25:43.90,Default,,0,0,0,,What? What--? What are you--?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:44.23,0:25:46.57,Default,,0,0,0,,What?\NWe'll just do it again.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:47.36,0:25:48.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Until we get it right.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:14.60,0:26:16.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Walt.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:18.27,0:26:20.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Please have a seat and join us.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:11.94,0:27:13.36,Default,,0,0,0,,We can do better.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:13.53,0:27:14.99,Default,,0,0,0,,No, don't you fucking\Nthink about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:15.16,0:27:18.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey.\NCome on.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:19.62,0:27:21.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Three entire pounds\Nof pseudo wasted.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:21.50,0:27:23.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you know how long\Nl had to spin that stupid sign?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:23.83,0:27:26.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Get off me, psycho.\NHelicopter, bitch!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:26.67,0:27:28.71,Default,,0,0,0,,[GLASS BREAKlNG]
Dialogue: 0,0:27:36.18,0:27:38.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, God!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:42.81,0:27:43.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Asshole.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:46.69,0:27:47.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Open the door.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:47.94,0:27:50.19,Default,,0,0,0,,[♪♪♪]
Dialogue: 0,0:27:52.44,0:27:54.36,Default,,0,0,0,,[ENGlNE STALLlNG]
Dialogue: 0,0:27:59.87,0:28:01.37,Default,,0,0,0,,[ENGlNE STARTS]
Dialogue: 0,0:28:09.54,0:28:12.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Come back here,\Nyou bitch!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:12.67,0:28:14.21,Default,,0,0,0,,l'm gonna\Nmess you up!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:15.97,0:28:17.85,Default,,0,0,0,,This isn't funny!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:23.02,0:28:24.40,Default,,0,0,0,,[GRUNTS]
Dialogue: 0,0:28:26.89,0:28:30.39,Default,,0,0,0,,l really need to understand\Nyour thought process,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:30.56,0:28:32.52,Default,,0,0,0,,because clearly l don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:32.69,0:28:37.53,Default,,0,0,0,,l feel that this decision\Nyou've made
Dialogue: 0,0:28:37.70,0:28:40.08,Default,,0,0,0,,is not only\Nnot in your best interest,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:40.24,0:28:43.70,Default,,0,0,0,,it's not in the best interest\Nof our entire family.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:44.08,0:28:47.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, Skyler--\NSKYLER: Not yet, please. l--
Dialogue: 0,0:28:48.08,0:28:50.08,Default,,0,0,0,,l have the talking pillow.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:52.42,0:28:54.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Everybody gets to speak\Ntheir minds, remember?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:54.76,0:28:57.43,Default,,0,0,0,,And then you'll get\Nyour chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:57.93,0:29:01.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Money has always been\Nan issue for us, l'll give you that.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:01.76,0:29:04.93,Default,,0,0,0,,But now that Elliott is more\Nthan willing to pitch in--
Dialogue: 0,0:29:05.10,0:29:08.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Walt, l know, l understand that\Nit's hard for you to accept help.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:08.60,0:29:10.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe it's the way\Nyou were raised.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:10.81,0:29:12.77,Default,,0,0,0,,But, honey,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:12.94,0:29:16.90,Default,,0,0,0,,it's okay to lean on people\Nnow and again.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:17.07,0:29:19.32,Default,,0,0,0,,You need this treatment.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:19.53,0:29:22.45,Default,,0,0,0,,And nothing can stop you\Nfrom getting it,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:22.62,0:29:24.29,Default,,0,0,0,,except you.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:31.96,0:29:35.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Am l allowed to respond?\NSKYLER: ln a minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:35.55,0:29:39.47,Default,,0,0,0,,l think we need to go\Naround the circle first.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:41.34,0:29:43.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Hank, would you\Nlike to start?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:46.18,0:29:50.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh, yeah. Okay, well...
Dialogue: 0,0:29:50.98,0:29:53.31,Default,,0,0,0,,What l would say is--\NTake the talking pillow.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:00.20,0:30:02.58,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, look, buddy, um,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:03.07,0:30:07.37,Default,,0,0,0,,l know l don't get to\Ntell you this enough,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:08.87,0:30:11.16,Default,,0,0,0,,but l care about you.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:11.83,0:30:13.96,Default,,0,0,0,,A hell of a lot.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:14.63,0:30:16.46,Default,,0,0,0,,And this cancer thing...
Dialogue: 0,0:30:17.13,0:30:21.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's just-- Let's face it, you know,\Nyou were dealt a shit hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:21.30,0:30:23.18,Default,,0,0,0,,But, um,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:23.34,0:30:25.30,Default,,0,0,0,,sometimes your luck can change.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:25.47,0:30:28.51,Default,,0,0,0,,l mean-- l mean, l can't tell\Nyou how many times l was--
Dialogue: 0,0:30:28.68,0:30:30.47,Default,,0,0,0,,You know,\Nl started with a shit hand
Dialogue: 0,0:30:30.64,0:30:34.35,Default,,0,0,0,,and l ended up with, you know,\Na full house. Okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:34.69,0:30:36.86,Default,,0,0,0,,l mean, the key is,\Nyou gotta hang in there.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:37.02,0:30:38.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Man, you gotta keep\Nplacing your bets,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:39.15,0:30:41.15,Default,,0,0,0,,keep placing your bets.\NBoom.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:42.74,0:30:45.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Hank, what the hell\Nare you saying?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:45.70,0:30:47.53,Default,,0,0,0,,SKYLER:\NPlease, Marie, let him talk.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:47.70,0:30:50.87,Default,,0,0,0,,That's what we're here\Nto do. Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:51.75,0:30:53.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Go on, Hank.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:54.54,0:30:58.71,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, look at it\Nthis way, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:58.88,0:31:03.68,Default,,0,0,0,,lt's the bottom of the ninth,\Nbases are loaded, you're up.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:04.22,0:31:06.56,Default,,0,0,0,,But you got\Na bum arm, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:06.72,0:31:10.01,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no fricking way\Nyou're gonna hit a homer, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:10.18,0:31:13.89,Default,,0,0,0,,So you can either let\Nthe pinch hitter take the bat,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:14.06,0:31:18.06,Default,,0,0,0,,or you can hold on to your\Npride and lose the game.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:18.40,0:31:20.40,Default,,0,0,0,,You get what\Nl'm saying?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:21.57,0:31:23.45,Default,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:25.70,0:31:28.41,Default,,0,0,0,,You got your pride, man.\Nl get it, okay? l get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:29.16,0:31:31.41,Default,,0,0,0,,But this Daddy Warbucks\Nwants to chip in, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:31.58,0:31:35.79,Default,,0,0,0,,l'm with your old lady on this one.\Nl say take the money and run, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:39.09,0:31:41.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Somebody wanna\Ntake this thing? Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:41.42,0:31:42.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, Walter--
Dialogue: 0,0:31:42.92,0:31:44.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Walter, Jr., l'm sure
Dialogue: 0,0:31:44.76,0:31:48.76,Default,,0,0,0,,that you have about a million\Nthings to say, probably.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:48.93,0:31:51.43,Default,,0,0,0,,And now is your chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:52.22,0:31:55.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Go ahead. Just let it all out.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:58.40,0:31:59.61,Default,,0,0,0,,This is bullshit.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:59.77,0:32:01.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, come on.\NSKYLER: lt's all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:01.94,0:32:03.73,Default,,0,0,0,,lt--
Dialogue: 0,0:32:06.57,0:32:08.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Talk.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:08.57,0:32:11.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Tell your dad how you feel.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:13.95,0:32:16.79,Default,,0,0,0,,l'm pissed off.\NTell him.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:17.50,0:32:20.17,Default,,0,0,0,,l'm pissed off.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:20.34,0:32:22.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Because you're being...
Dialogue: 0,0:32:23.63,0:32:24.96,Default,,0,0,0,,You're--
Dialogue: 0,0:32:27.13,0:32:28.63,Default,,0,0,0,,You're a pussy.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:30.64,0:32:33.98,Default,,0,0,0,,You're, like,\Nready to give up.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:36.23,0:32:39.77,Default,,0,0,0,,You're-- God.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:39.94,0:32:42.44,Default,,0,0,0,,What if you gave up\Non me, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:48.45,0:32:50.20,Default,,0,0,0,,This here,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:50.37,0:32:52.46,Default,,0,0,0,,all the stuff\Nl've been through,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:52.62,0:32:56.96,Default,,0,0,0,,and you're scared\Nof a little chemotherapy?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:11.47,0:33:14.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Me, personally,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:16.06,0:33:18.65,Default,,0,0,0,,l think you should do\Nwhatever you wanna do.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:20.52,0:33:22.06,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:22.86,0:33:25.32,Default,,0,0,0,,You told us to be honest\Nabout our feelings.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:25.48,0:33:27.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Walt's the one with cancer,\Nit's his decision.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:27.82,0:33:29.82,Default,,0,0,0,,lt's not up to any of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:29.99,0:33:34.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Why in hell would you do this?\NHey, hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:34.66,0:33:37.83,Default,,0,0,0,,l wasn't planning\Non agreeing with Walt.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:38.00,0:33:42.38,Default,,0,0,0,,But after sitting here and listening\Nto you all talk about his future\Nlike he has no say in it--
Dialogue: 0,0:33:42.54,0:33:46.54,Default,,0,0,0,,He's not gonna have a future\Nif he doesn't get treatment.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:46.71,0:33:49.71,Default,,0,0,0,,l am a medical professional.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:49.88,0:33:53.88,Default,,0,0,0,,l x-ray people in treatment\Nevery day.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:54.05,0:33:56.55,Default,,0,0,0,,l see them every day.\NAnd you know what?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:56.72,0:34:00.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Some of them\Nare absolutely miserable.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:00.73,0:34:03.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Marie--\Nl'm sorry, but it's true.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:03.56,0:34:05.23,Default,,0,0,0,,And some of them\Ndon't wanna
Dialogue: 0,0:34:05.40,0:34:08.24,Default,,0,0,0,,spend their last weeks\Nor months
Dialogue: 0,0:34:08.40,0:34:10.90,Default,,0,0,0,,being picked at by doctors.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:11.07,0:34:13.53,Default,,0,0,0,,But they got talked into it\Nby their families.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:13.70,0:34:15.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Can l get the pillow back?\Nl agree with Marie on this one.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:16.03,0:34:17.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you.\NSKYLER: Hank--
Dialogue: 0,0:34:17.24,0:34:19.41,Default,,0,0,0,,What? Maybe Walt wants\Nto die like a man, all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:19.58,0:34:22.08,Default,,0,0,0,,l don't want him to die at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:22.25,0:34:25.54,Default,,0,0,0,,That's the whole point of this.\NSo either help or leave.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:25.92,0:34:28.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Skyler, l just wanted\Nto do you the courtesy
Dialogue: 0,0:34:28.96,0:34:31.25,Default,,0,0,0,,of giving you\Nmy honest opinion.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:31.42,0:34:35.09,Default,,0,0,0,,You know, Marie,\Nthis is not debate club.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:35.26,0:34:37.14,Default,,0,0,0,,This is my husband's life\Nwe're talking about here.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:37.35,0:34:40.64,Default,,0,0,0,,You know, l made one\Nsimple observation--
Dialogue: 0,0:34:40.85,0:34:43.48,Default,,0,0,0,,And it's like you--\NHow dare you--
Dialogue: 0,0:34:43.65,0:34:45.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, so we disagree--\NLadies! Marie!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:45.44,0:34:46.61,Default,,0,0,0,,[WHlSTLES]
Dialogue: 0,0:34:48.90,0:34:51.36,Default,,0,0,0,,This is so stupid.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:55.87,0:34:57.95,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, l've got\Nthe talking pillow now.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:59.37,0:35:00.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:11.30,0:35:14.30,Default,,0,0,0,,We all, in this room,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:14.68,0:35:16.81,Default,,0,0,0,,we love each other.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:17.10,0:35:20.69,Default,,0,0,0,,We want what's best for\Neach other, and l know that.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:21.10,0:35:23.64,Default,,0,0,0,,l am very thankful\Nfor that.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:24.98,0:35:28.44,Default,,0,0,0,,But what l want--
Dialogue: 0,0:35:30.98,0:35:34.32,Default,,0,0,0,,What l want,\Nwhat l need...
Dialogue: 0,0:35:35.70,0:35:38.29,Default,,0,0,0,,is a choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:38.91,0:35:42.95,Default,,0,0,0,,What does that mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:44.71,0:35:49.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Sometimes l feel like\Nl never actually
Dialogue: 0,0:35:50.00,0:35:53.67,Default,,0,0,0,,make any of my own choices,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:53.84,0:35:55.63,Default,,0,0,0,,l mean.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:01.51,0:36:03.05,Default,,0,0,0,,My entire life,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:04.64,0:36:06.85,Default,,0,0,0,,it just seems l never. ..
Dialogue: 0,0:36:09.86,0:36:14.24,Default,,0,0,0,,you know, had a real say\Nabout any of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:17.20,0:36:20.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, this last one, cancer,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:22.37,0:36:26.58,Default,,0,0,0,,all l have left is how\Nl choose to approach this.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:26.75,0:36:29.75,Default,,0,0,0,,SKYLER:\NThen make the right choice, Walt.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:30.54,0:36:33.54,Default,,0,0,0,,You are not the\Nonly one it affects.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:34.51,0:36:36.18,Default,,0,0,0,,What about your son?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:37.88,0:36:42.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't you wanna see your\Ndaughter grow up? l just. ..
Dialogue: 0,0:36:47.02,0:36:49.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course l do.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:50.98,0:36:55.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Skyler, you've read\Nthe statistics, you. . .
Dialogue: 0,0:36:57.57,0:36:59.24,Default,,0,0,0,,[SlGHS]
Dialogue: 0,0:37:00.62,0:37:02.45,Default,,0,0,0,,These doctors
Dialogue: 0,0:37:02.62,0:37:05.62,Default,,0,0,0,,talking about "surviving"
Dialogue: 0,0:37:05.79,0:37:10.38,Default,,0,0,0,,one year, two years,\Nlike it's the only thing\Nthat matters.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:10.54,0:37:13.42,Default,,0,0,0,,But what good is it\Nto just survive
Dialogue: 0,0:37:13.59,0:37:17.59,Default,,0,0,0,,if l am too sick to work?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:18.59,0:37:21.26,Default,,0,0,0,,To enjoy a meal?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:23.26,0:37:25.14,Default,,0,0,0,,To make love?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:32.06,0:37:34.94,Default,,0,0,0,,For what time l have left...
Dialogue: 0,0:37:37.15,0:37:39.44,Default,,0,0,0,,l wanna live in my own house.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:39.61,0:37:42.45,Default,,0,0,0,,l wanna sleep in my own bed.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:42.62,0:37:46.25,Default,,0,0,0,,l don't wanna choke down\N30 or 40 pills every single day,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:46.41,0:37:47.62,Default,,0,0,0,,and lose my hair,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:48.16,0:37:52.58,Default,,0,0,0,,and lie around,\Ntoo tired to get up,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:54.67,0:37:58.76,Default,,0,0,0,,and so nauseated\Nthat l can't even move my head.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:00.80,0:38:02.63,Default,,0,0,0,,And you.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:03.05,0:38:05.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Cleaning up\Nafter me.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:07.68,0:38:09.77,Default,,0,0,0,,And me? What--?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:10.48,0:38:12.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Some, uh--
Dialogue: 0,0:38:12.60,0:38:17.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Some dead man,\Nsome artificially alive--
Dialogue: 0,0:38:17.82,0:38:21.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Just marking time.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:22.70,0:38:24.95,Default,,0,0,0,,No. No.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:28.45,0:38:31.58,Default,,0,0,0,,And that's how you\Nwould remember me.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:37.59,0:38:39.97,Default,,0,0,0,,That's the worst part.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:42.88,0:38:48.97,Default,,0,0,0,,So that is my thought process,\NSkyler.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:50.52,0:38:53.31,Default,,0,0,0,,l'm sorry. l just...
Dialogue: 0,0:38:57.40,0:39:00.82,Default,,0,0,0,,l choose not to do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:05.74,0:39:07.87,Default,,0,0,0,,[♪♪♪]
Dialogue: 0,0:40:55.27,0:40:57.02,Default,,0,0,0,,All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:00.27,0:41:02.48,Default,,0,0,0,,"All right" what?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:05.65,0:41:08.15,Default,,0,0,0,,l'll do the treatment.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:11.49,0:41:12.78,Default,,0,0,0,,[PAN CLATTERS]
Dialogue: 0,0:41:39.14,0:41:41.52,Default,,0,0,0,,lt's gonna be okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:41.98,0:41:43.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:47.69,0:41:50.82,Default,,0,0,0,,[EASY-LlSTENlNG MUSlC\NPLAYlNG OVER PA]
Dialogue: 0,0:42:09.42,0:42:11.09,Default,,0,0,0,,The lady from\Nthe billing office
Dialogue: 0,0:42:11.30,0:42:14.22,Default,,0,0,0,,said they usually bill the\Ninsurance company directly.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:14.39,0:42:18.77,Default,,0,0,0,,But since our HMO's not\Npaying for it, we can pay up\Nfront with a credit card.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:18.93,0:42:21.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh. Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:22.23,0:42:26.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, and then Elliott\Nwill send a check, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:26.94,0:42:29.73,Default,,0,0,0,,l will take care of it, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:34.70,0:42:36.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Walter White?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:36.91,0:42:38.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:40.87,0:42:42.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:43.33,0:42:44.58,Default,,0,0,0,,All right.\NSKYLER: Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:44.75,0:42:47.59,Default,,0,0,0,,See you in a minute. Okay.\NOkay.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:53.43,0:42:56.10,Default,,0,0,0,,[♪♪♪]
Dialogue: 0,0:43:18.95,0:43:20.95,Default,,0,0,0,,[WHlRRlNG]
Dialogue: 0,0:43:31.96,0:43:34.00,Default,,0,0,0,,[BEEPlNG]
Dialogue: 0,0:43:39.18,0:43:41.31,Default,,0,0,0,,[♪♪♪]
Dialogue: 0,0:44:02.20,0:44:04.33,Default,,0,0,0,,[CELL PHONE RlNGlNG]
Dialogue: 0,0:44:18.18,0:44:20.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Heh-heh. Elliott.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:20.35,0:44:22.73,Default,,0,0,0,,GRETCHEN:\NWalt, it's Gretchen.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:24.06,0:44:27.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, hey. Hey, Gretchen,\Nhow are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:27.69,0:44:31.53,Default,,0,0,0,,You know, it was really great seeing\Nyou two the other day, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:31.69,0:44:33.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow, what a party.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:33.82,0:44:38.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Walt, Elliott told me\Nabout the cancer.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:38.82,0:44:42.16,Default,,0,0,0,,l'm so sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:43.95,0:44:45.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, you know,
Dialogue: 0,0:44:45.71,0:44:47.92,Default,,0,0,0,,it is what it is, l guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:48.08,0:44:50.21,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know what to say.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:50.38,0:44:53.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Except, l'm always here for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:54.05,0:44:57.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Both of us are.\NWe wanted you to know that.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:58.84,0:45:01.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, well, thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:02.72,0:45:07.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Walt, Elliott told me he'd offered\Nto pay for the treatment.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:07.98,0:45:09.06,Default,,0,0,0,,You haνe to accept.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:09.23,0:45:13.90,Default,,0,0,0,,That money, as far as\Nwe're both concerned,\Nthat belongs to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:14.07,0:45:17.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Even the name of our\Ncompany, it's half yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:20.07,0:45:21.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Walt?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:24.29,0:45:27.38,Default,,0,0,0,,ls this about you and me?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:39.55,0:45:41.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Gretchen, l really\Nappreciate the offer.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:42.09,0:45:45.64,Default,,0,0,0,,l do. But we're fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:46.77,0:45:50.27,Default,,0,0,0,,As it turns out,\Nthe insurance came\Nthrough after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:50.44,0:45:56.03,Default,,0,0,0,,So, um, l am covered.\NAnd, uh.. .
Dialogue: 0,0:45:56.32,0:45:59.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, and, anyway,\NI really appreciate it, l really do.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:59.28,0:46:01.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:01.95,0:46:04.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Good. That's good news.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:06.12,0:46:09.16,Default,,0,0,0,,You know, that really\Nwas a great party.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:12.25,0:46:16.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Keep in touch, okay?\NSure. Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:17.09,0:46:19.34,Default,,0,0,0,,And thank you for calling.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:26.68,0:46:27.93,Default,,0,0,0,,[PHONE BEEPS]
Dialogue: 0,0:46:52.96,0:46:54.79,Default,,0,0,0,,[DOOR OPENS]
Dialogue: 0,0:46:59.17,0:47:00.71,Default,,0,0,0,,[SCOFFS]
Dialogue: 0,0:47:08.10,0:47:09.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Yo!
Dialogue: 0,0:47:18.02,0:47:19.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Wanna cook?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:30.83,0:47:33.21,Default,,0,0,0,,[♪♪♪]
